---
/*
 * Section 6 — start with one.
 *
 * DELIBERATE DEVIATION FROM THE MOCKUP, FLAGGED FOR FREDRICK.
 *
 * The approved mockup put a white card here containing a "The foundation is built
 * once" bar chart with three jobs and a colour legend. The spec's design note for this
 * section is explicit and gives its reason:
 *
 *     "short band, no cards, no icons. It should read as a considered aside,
 *      not a pitch."
 *
 * CLAUDE.md's order of truth puts docs/page-spec.md above the mockups, so this is built
 * as the aside the spec asks for. The chart is a small change to restore if Fredrick
 * prefers the mockup — say so and it comes back. Note that the mockup files themselves
 * have since been removed from the repository; section 6 of docs/page-spec.md remains.
 */
---

<section class="start-with-one">
  <div class="container start-with-one__inner">
    <h2 class="start-with-one__title">Start with one. Not with everything.</h2>

    <div class="start-with-one__copy">
      <p class="start-with-one__body">
        The businesses getting real value from AI didn&rsquo;t transform overnight
        &mdash; they made one thing faster, properly, then the next. Every hour that
        comes back goes where it earns: your clients, your work, your growth. And the
        foundation only gets built once, so each one after the first lands faster than
        the one before.
      </p>

      <p class="start-with-one__kicker">
        A year from now, that is the difference between still thinking about AI and
        already using it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .start-with-one {
    padding-block: 88px;
  }

  .start-with-one__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 0.95fr);
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .start-with-one__title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .start-with-one__body {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
    color: #4a463f;
  }

  .start-with-one__kicker {
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-family: var(--ark-font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.38;
    color: var(--ark-olive);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .start-with-one {
      padding-block: 52px;
    }

    .start-with-one__inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 22px;
    }

    .start-with-one__title {
      font-size: var(--ark-h2);
    }

    .start-with-one__body {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .start-with-one__kicker {
      margin-top: 22px;
      font-size: 1.24rem;
    }
  }
</style>
